"..one has everything?"
1) Helm of Brilliance is always good for any spellcaster
2) For that little extra armor boost, a +5 or better T-shirt
3) blessed scrolls of earth for that instant fort in which to hide
4) a saddle -- you can't ride very well; but, riding to your ascension 
shows good style. Riding allows you to carry more "everything".
5) magic harp -- tame a mount to put the saddle on; and keep yourself 
surrounded by friends so you don't have to fight.
6) Horn of plenty -- keep your power for useful spells, create food to 
feed your mount if a herbivore.
7) Wands of death -- you can never have too many.
8) scrolls of charging to keep all those fun items charged


